<main id="main">

<!-- ============ HERO ============ -->
<section class="hero" id="top" aria-label="KRISEVA: a tender is a decision system">
  <div class="hero-stage" id="heroStage" data-cursor="trace">
    <canvas id="webgl" aria-hidden="true"></canvas>

    <!-- Static plate: shown on mobile, reduced-motion, or when WebGL is unavailable -->
    <div class="hero-static" aria-hidden="true">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 760 560" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-label="An ink-drawn plate: a tender bundle on the left, brass evidence strands tracing to clause references that resolve into six verdict states">
        <g stroke="#17130D" stroke-width="1.2" opacity=".9">
          <rect x="46" y="180" width="150" height="208" fill="#F3EDE0" transform="rotate(-4 121 284)"/>
          <rect x="56" y="172" width="150" height="208" fill="#F3EDE0" transform="rotate(-1 131 276)"/>
          <rect x="66" y="164" width="150" height="208" fill="#F3EDE0" transform="rotate(2 141 268)"/>
        </g>
        <g stroke="#4E4838" stroke-width="1" opacity=".55">
          <line x1="84" y1="196" x2="196" y2="200"/><line x1="84" y1="214" x2="186" y2="218"/>
          <line x1="84" y1="232" x2="196" y2="236"/><line x1="84" y1="250" x2="176" y2="254"/>
          <line x1="84" y1="286" x2="196" y2="290"/><line x1="84" y1="304" x2="186" y2="308"/>
        </g>
        <g stroke="#A87229" stroke-width="1.6" fill="none" opacity=".95">
          <path d="M216 220 C 320 140, 420 120, 520 96"/>
          <path d="M216 240 C 330 200, 430 178, 548 170"/>
          <path d="M216 262 C 340 260, 440 248, 560 244"/>
          <path d="M216 284 C 340 320, 440 314, 556 318"/>
          <path d="M216 306 C 330 380, 430 386, 540 392"/>
          <path d="M216 328 C 320 440, 410 456, 520 464"/>
        </g>
        <g font-family="IBM Plex Mono,monospace" font-size="11" letter-spacing="1">
          <g><rect x="524" y="82" width="170" height="26" fill="#F3EDE0" stroke="#3A7A5B"/><text x="536" y="99" fill="#2E6149">SPEC §3.2 · VERIFIED</text></g>
          <g><rect x="552" y="156" width="186" height="26" fill="#F3EDE0" stroke="#9A7322"/><text x="562" y="173" fill="#6E520F">ANNEX-C · QUALIFIED</text></g>
          <g><rect x="564" y="230" width="170" height="26" fill="#F3EDE0" stroke="#41618C"/><text x="576" y="247" fill="#324C6E">BID-DOC · REQ-DEMO</text></g>
          <g><rect x="560" y="304" width="186" height="26" fill="#F3EDE0" stroke="#5F6A79"/><text x="572" y="321" fill="#454F5D">FIN-2 · INSUFFICIENT</text></g>
          <g><rect x="544" y="378" width="150" height="26" fill="#F3EDE0" stroke="#9C4F43"/><text x="556" y="395" fill="#7E3A2F">FIN-1 · MISSING</text></g>
          <g><rect x="524" y="450" width="156" height="26" fill="#F3EDE0" stroke="#83332D"/><text x="536" y="467" fill="#6E2B26">ATC §7.1 · FAILED</text></g>
        </g>
        <g font-family="IBM Plex Mono,monospace" font-size="9" letter-spacing="2" fill="#4E4838">
          <text x="46" y="420">TENDER BUNDLE</text>
          <text x="524" y="510">VERDICT LEDGER · EVERY STATE CARRIES ITS SOURCE</text>
        </g>
      </svg>
    </div>

    <div class="hero-labels" id="heroLabels" aria-hidden="true"></div>

    <div class="wrap hero-content">
      <p class="eyebrow">Kriseva AI · Procurement intelligence · India's defence ecosystem</p>
      <h1 class="display" id="heroH1">
        <span class="ln"><span class="ln-in">A tender is not a PDF.</span></span>
        <span class="ln"><span class="ln-in">It is a <em class="em-brass">decision system</em></span></span>
        <span class="ln"><span class="ln-in">hidden inside a document bundle.</span></span>
      </h1>
      <p class="dek rv">Deterministic, auditable procurement intelligence for the teams that <b>bid</b> and the committees that <b>evaluate</b>. Every verdict linked to a clause and a page. <button class="kchip-claim" type="button" data-claim="positioning.thesis" aria-label="Provenance: the thesis">c1</button></p>
      <div class="hero-acts rv">
        <a class="btn btn-fill magnetic" href="/contact" data-cursor="write">Request a demo <span class="arr">→</span></a>
        <a class="btn btn-line magnetic" href="#evidence" data-cursor="inspect">See the evidence</a>
        <button class="btn btn-line magnetic" id="tourStart" data-cursor="walk" hidden>Guided walk · press T</button>
      </div>
      <div class="cred rv" aria-label="Credibility record">
        <span><b>Grand Finalist</b> · Pan IIT “AI for Bharat” · 13,500+ teams</span>
        <span><b>Udyam</b>-registered MSME</span>
        <span>Incubated at <b>IIT Gandhinagar</b> · IIEC</span>
        <span>In active evaluation with <b>a central armed police force</b></span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="scroll-cue" id="scrollCue" aria-hidden="true"><span class="line"></span>Scroll to trace the evidence<span class="line"></span></div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ════════════ ACT 1 · THE NATION'S CLOCK ════════════ -->
<div class="act-break wrap rv" data-act="1">
  <div class="ab-row"><span class="ab-no">ACT 01</span><span class="ab-title">The nation's clock</span></div>
  <p class="ab-line">India's modernization does not lack technology, capital, or talent. It waits on a cycle.</p>
</div>

<section class="clock-sec" id="clock" aria-label="The procurement cycle, in years">
  <div class="clock-stage wrap" id="clockStage">
    <div class="clock-top">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow rv" style="margin-bottom:16px">The problem · one acquisition, many stations</p>
        <h2 class="display"><span class="ln"><span class="ln-in">The bottleneck</span></span><span class="ln"><span class="ln-in">is the <em class="em-brass">cycle.</em></span></span></h2>
        <p class="dek rv" style="margin-top:18px">When the armed forces need new equipment, they cannot simply buy it. A request begins a journey through stations of approval, bidding and checking. Watch one acquisition travel, and watch the clock.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="yearbox rv" id="yearBox" aria-hidden="true">
        <span class="yk">Elapsed</span>
        <span class="yr"><span class="yr-live">YEAR <i id="yearN">1</i></span><span class="yr-aged">Years later</span></span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="cycle rv" id="cycle">
      <div class="crail" aria-hidden="true"><div class="cfill" id="cycleFill"></div><div class="cdot" id="cycleDot"></div></div>
      <ol class="cstations" id="cycleStations">
        <li class="cst"><span class="tick" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="nm">01 · Need</span><span class="cap">A unit states what it needs.</span></li>
        <li class="cst"><span class="tick" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="nm">02 · Approval</span><span class="cap">The need is examined and accepted: the <button class="kchip-gloss" type="button" data-gloss="aon">AoN</button>.</span></li>
        <li class="cst"><span class="tick" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="nm">03 · <button class="kchip-gloss" type="button" data-gloss="rfp">RFP</button></span><span class="cap">The request goes out to industry.</span></li>
        <li class="cst"><span class="tick" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="nm">04 · Bids</span><span class="cap">Companies answer with bundles of documents.</span></li>
        <li class="cst"><span class="tick" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="nm">05 · Evaluation</span><span class="cap">A committee checks every claim in every bid.</span></li>
        <li class="cst"><span class="tick" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="nm">06 · Re-evaluation</span><span class="cap">Queries and disputes restart the clock.</span></li>
        <li class="cst"><span class="tick" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="nm">07 · Award</span><span class="cap">Years later, a contract. The need has aged.</span></li>
      </ol>
    </div>
    <p class="clock-line rv">The speed of modernization is set by the <em class="em-brass">speed of the cycle.</em></p>
    <p class="src-note clock-src rv">Stage names follow <button class="kchip-gloss" type="button" data-gloss="dap">DAP 2020</button>, the public rulebook · qualitative by design: this page claims no specific duration</p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ════════════ ACT 2 · TWO ROOMS, ONE PROBLEM ════════════ -->
<div class="act-break wrap rv" data-act="2">
  <div class="ab-row"><span class="ab-no">ACT 02</span><span class="ab-title">Two rooms, one problem</span></div>
  <p class="ab-line">On one side of the table, a small team and a heavy bundle. On the other, a committee that must be right.</p>
</div>

<section class="sec-pad" id="rooms" style="padding-top:clamp(40px,5vw,70px)">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="rooms">
      <article class="room room-a rv regmark" data-cursor="inspect">
        <div class="rh"><span>Room A · the bidder</span><span>a defence <button class="kchip-gloss" type="button" data-gloss="msme">MSME</button> office</span></div>
        <h3>The team that bids.</h3>
        <p class="rplain">A small company finds a tender it could win. Then the bundle arrives.</p>
        <div class="rfig" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 560 320" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" id="bundleX">
