        <ul class="caps">
          <li><span><b>Three-path convergence</b> reasoning on every criterion. <button class="kchip-claim" type="button" data-claim="evaluator.three-path" aria-label="Provenance: three-path convergence">c3</button></span><span class="ref">reproducible</span></li>
