          <li><span><b>On-premise, local LLM, zero egress</b>, built for networks that do not leave the building. <button class="kchip-claim" type="button" data-claim="evaluator.sovereign" aria-label="Provenance: sovereign posture">c6</button></span><span class="ref">sovereign-by-design</span></li>
