   an Astro island <HeroLedger client:visible> wrapping the canvas + labels +
   the IIFE; each module (matrix/chain/radar/boundary/pipeline) is a small
   vanilla-JS island with client:visible. GSAP/Lenis/Three move to npm deps,
   imported inside islands so SSR never touches window.
3. Copy: all claim-bearing strings here trace to publicClaims.ts wording or
